======================================================================
SYNTHESIS
======================================================================

The simplified race analysis captures the EXACT outcome when no
runner swaps occur during the race interval.  For initial segments,
the tie races (race_ratio = 1) correspond to the wall-only LL witnesses.
The full picture requires tracking runner swaps during the race.

